# DevOps & Docker

## Local stack

`docker/docker-compose.yml` services:

| Service | Image / build | Port |
|---------|---------------|------|
| postgres | postgres:16-alpine | 5432 |
| redis | redis:7-alpine | 6379 |
| api | `apps/api/Dockerfile` | 3001 |
| admin | `apps/admin/Dockerfile` | 3000 |
| merchant | `apps/merchant/Dockerfile` | 3002 |

## Compose profiles

- `dev`: hot-reload mounts, exposed ports, debug env
- `prod`: optimized builds, no source mounts

## Dockerfile rules

- Multi-stage builds (deps → build → runtime)
- Run as non-root user
- Include `HEALTHCHECK` instructions
- Pin base image versions

## Environment

- Document all vars in `.env.example` at repo root
- Never commit `.env` files
- Use `${VAR:?required}` in compose for mandatory secrets

## CI (`.github/workflows/`)

When implementing GitHub Actions, follow `.cursor/rules/github-workflow.mdc` for job order and PR gates:

- Lint → test → build on every PR
- Cache node_modules / pnpm store
- Build Docker images on merge to main
